<title>USA: InterVoice sees Q3 shr $0.15 to $0.17.</title>
<headline>InterVoice sees Q3 shr $0.15 to $0.17.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>InterVoice Inc said on Wednesday that it is expecting to report lower third quarter earnings a share between $0.15 and $0.17 for the period to November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues are expected to be about $24.3 million, compared with $25.1 million in revenues and earnings per share of $0.27 a year ago.</p>
<p>The supplier of automated call processing systems said the recent judicial stay of portions of the Telecommunications Act of 1996 has caused some telecommunications companies to delay orders, Intervoice said.</p>
</text>
